      "text": "$GOOGL\n updates FY 2026 capex guidance:\n\nTo $195B-$205B. Up from $180B-$190B. \n\nGoogle is also expected to significantly increase capex in 2027.  \n\nThis is perhaps the most bullish read through on upstream semis from a hyperscaler.",
