      "ingestedAt": "2026-07-29T20:10:32Z",
      "text": "I've been out if it recently, just recovering from 2 rounds of surgery. \n\nDrop was been surprising to say the least given \n$GOOGL\n hiked capex guidance last week.  \n\nWill need to check on rate hike odds, but my guess is just deleveraging.",
