      "text": "US Gov to take 1% stake in \n$GFS\n, and award them $300m for the US CHIPS ACT.\n\nThis is actually a strong read through on $SIVE / \n$LITE\n, given this CHIPS ACT is specifically aimed at advancing CPO + Silicon Photonics. \n\n(For reference, Sivers and Lumentum were the only two public laser suppliers named in GFS presentation slides. Sivers laser arrays was named recently as a reference design in Globalfoundries SCALE for CPO).  \n\nPer US Gov announcement: \"GlobalFoundries will receive up to $300 million to accelerate domestic CPO R&D by two to three years\" (NIST)\n\nNever thought we'd see the US Gov / \n$INTC\n foundry playbook for CPO in specific...",
