      "text": "Just some near term events:\n\n- OCP APAC tomorrow (Ayar, Lightmatter, $AMD, $NVDA) and your CPO players are giving announcements/updates.\n\nThis should be a catalyst for certain optical players.\n\n- Earnings week: with $ASTS, $RKLB reporting today (space), $LITE on Tuesday (photonics), $NBIS in the middle of the week (Neocloud), and more.\n\n- Unitree IPO subscriptions opened up today and Listing is expected this month.\n\nShould be a potential catalyst for the humanoid + robotics sector if it opens up well eg. $CCXI.\n\nFun week ahead. https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2086634510935118161",
