        "view": "No new theses at all this week \u2014 the name is holding its Core place on accumulated score, not on fresh evidence. The CHIPS silicon-photonics award and the named SCALE CPO customer list remain the whole case, and $300m is still immaterial to a company this size. Worth naming that a Core-tier name with zero weekly flow is a stale ranking as much as a live idea.",
        "execution": "No dedicated action. SIVE and LITE carry the CPO-platform exposure with more torque; GFS is the confirmation, not the vehicle.",
        "changesMind": "GlobalFoundries disclosing silicon photonics as a reported segment, which would make it a CPO pure-play rather than a diversified foundry holding a grant.",
