        "stance": "watch",
        "previousStance": "watch",
        "view": "No new analyst posts this week; the only fresh material is the desk's own research from the previous pass, and that changes nothing. The disclosed 14A schedule is still risk production in 2027 and high volume in 2028, so external foundry revenue is not a 2026 or 2027 event, and the China CPU long-term agreement story remains a press report rather than a filing.",
